{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Do not treat every Number as immutable**\n\n`Number` includes mutable types such as `AtomicInteger`, `AtomicLong`, and custom implementations. Returning them unchanged means a first exporter can mutate a payload value that later exporters still share, defeating the isolation guarantee. Share only known immutable numeric classes or convert arbitrary numbers into detached JSON scalars; add an `AtomicInteger` isolation test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7nh9fH","finding_digest":"8e6c376214265f1d40c1c7b6864d97136c58335d2d618a641524f1e001a94dd8","finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsightrecord.java::operations::exporter-mutation-isolation","line":57,"observation_digest":"6c929c651c6f61a4bc0ecb10959fb8f1f28fabb763b3119efb26fae8640c0a55","observation_id":"aro_v1_nsjjyzi4n5q2jpaozmijlh5y6h","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/Json.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rzwdoyquezpr2qgby63imtmxcn","published_at":"2026-08-28T22:27:10Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5xididmhluq4mhdhugntjpm257","reviewed_base_sha":"6501c39f553655583e33238eb1d821e4f44b8e26","reviewed_head_sha":"bdbd88fcdf777f50567d968c0e73fa11c8eb39ad","reviewer":"codex","start_line":57,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_6bgxnewdvnxsnwedp6wifdlft4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-28T22:27:10Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
